cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: "parareal-spectral-sl: a spectral semi-Lagrangian coarse propagator for Parareal"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a coarse propagator for the Parareal solution of
  the one-dimensional wave equation. The characteristic interval integral of
  d'Alembert's formula is evaluated exactly in Fourier space, so that the only
  remaining approximation is the interpolation of the characteristic feet.
  The repository reproduces Figures 3, 4 and 6 of the accompanying manuscript.
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Shijian
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-24"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - parareal
  - parallel-in-time
  - semi-Lagrangian
  - spectral methods
  - wave equation
references:
